# Guarantee band LOCKED 2026-09-11

## Type (section CSS)
- Section frame (`.guarantee-section`): `border-top` + `border-bottom` `1px solid #d6cfc0` — thin line under the band before Juicer (and matching top edge). Do not remove either border.
- Section title: `title_role: display` on PDPs (`h2-display`).
- Column titles (`.guarantee-item h4`): **Type H3** via `--type-guarantee-column-size` (= `--type-h3-size` `clamp(18px, 2vw, 22px)`) / weight `500`. Sitewide — one liquid file for Home + all PDPs. Never hardcode 20–26 loud or 14–15 tiny. lock-scan enforces token + outline CTA colors.
- Home pattern: loud section title + compact columns + short detail lines + one outline **See details →**.

