## Home (index)
- Keep Home’s 4-up trust set (Free Shipping / Made in USA stay).
- Where columns share Returns / Warranty titles, use the same locked detail lines as PDPs.

## CTA (outline)
- `cta_text_color` + `cta_border_color` = `#1c1916` on every template with outline CTA.
- Liquid defaults outline label to `#1c1916` (never `#ffffff`).
- Missing colors = invisible button. lock-scan fails white/missing outline text color.
